SillyTavern has been installed in %%WWWDIR%%.

Enable and start the service:

    sysrc sillytavern_enable=YES
    service sillytavern start

The default configuration listens on 127.0.0.1:8000 only. To allow clients
from your network, set "listen: true" in %%ETCDIR%%/config.yaml and add the
client address or subnet to the "whitelist" list, then restart the service:

    service sillytavern restart

Configuration: %%ETCDIR%%/config.yaml
User data:     /var/db/sillytavern
Service log:   /var/log/sillytavern.log

Extra command line options can be passed through sillytavern_flags in
/etc/rc.conf.
